     12252 :: ]Castle[/unclear] August . 23 Maj Eckert . Can you let me have [unclear][/unclear] again at Drummondtown . Northrup has not been on hand this P. M. can place no reliance on him [unclear]Eastville[/unclear] . have important messages for him M. V. B. Buell. 8.30A Aug 24 Hd. Qrs. A. P. Aug 23 Maj Eckert . Please send me one thousand (1000) Rubber insulators as soon as possible . D. Doren
     13129 :: Oct. 18 Major Eckert Please send me a box of insulators & spike to my address at Salisbury by express . Am having some trouble with poles again they seem to be rotting fast . Will have a detail made & set at work between Drummondtown & Newtown M. V. Buell
     12700 :: July 10 New Castle July 10 Maj Eckert All right Will keep Sheldon posted MVB Buell 7.10P July 10 New Castle July 10 Maj TT Eckert In case the communication with Washington should be interrupted for any length of time and you desire to send important messages to Phila or N. Y. They can go via Point Lookout to Sheldon & he can forward them to me & I will see that they are got off M. V. B Buell
     13685 :: New Castle 7 5 Maj Eckert Nothing south of Salisbury since 330PM Have started repairer south . Trouble last night seven poles down below Princess Ann will rebuild that section as soon as weather permits from north west MVB Buell Louisville Jany 8 5 Lines South OK to Nashville Chatta Pulaski Huntsville Decatur Knoxville & Dalton This morning S. Bruch
